 in die Unterwasserwelt ein - in 3D. Das Video zeigt alle Aquarien und Fische in maximaler Qualit\u00e4t. Wenn Sie dieses Video gesehen haben, m\u00f6chten Sie selbst dort hin. Sie k\u00f6nnen mit den Tasten auf dem linken Controller umschalten: X,A: 2D Video, Y,B: 3D Video. Die Leinwand wird gew\u00f6lbt dargestellt und Sie k\u00f6nnen davor den Kopf schwenken, f\u00fcr das beste 3D Erlebnis.", "short_description": "Das Aquarium \"Blu Planet\" in Copenhagen ist eines der gr\u00f6\u00dften und sch\u00f6nsten Aquarien auf der Welt."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pocketkai.net/asp/meta-copenhagen.htm", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pocketkai", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://pocketkai.de/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de_CH"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8800458760062438"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391785_991785716304569_1037346702959823201_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zvP79UbF08IQ7kNvwGyXU2c&_nc_oc=Adrz9Q81fMzQRjQxzuAL74HFGTfabaYexx2FxNw2xcsnH_EBV7fM4zebhEr2W69p928&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOdZ7Shmq9nvZhWUoldF9VxlF3jT0ZbYKEqFGkp5axYRA&oe=6ADE2948"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false,